===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|base}}, {{m|enm|bas}}, from {{der|en|fro|bas}}, from {{der|en|LL.|bassus|t=low}}. Cognate with {{cog|es|bajo}}, {{cog|it|basso}} and {{m|en|base}}.

